@startuml

title SerialToAnalog App - Static View

package "SerialToAnalog App" {
    [Command Handler] as cmdHandler
    [Channel Manager] as channelMgr
    [Sampling Controller] as samplingCtrl
    [Averaging Engine] as averaging
    [Threshold Monitor] as thresholdMon
    [Config Manager] as configMgr
}

[ADC Driver] as adcDriver
[Config Service] as configService

cmdHandler --> channelMgr : Channel commands
channelMgr --> adcDriver : ADC operations
samplingCtrl --> adcDriver : Start/stop sampling
averaging --> adcDriver : Read samples
thresholdMon --> channelMgr : Monitor values
configMgr --> configService : Load/save config

note right of channelMgr
  Works with raw ADC values only
  No calibration or conversion service dependencies
end note

@enduml
